    }
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "どうしたんだ、甘奈\r\n帰らないのか？",
    "charLabel": "amana",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2014003010010,
    "speaker": "甘奈",
    "text": "あ、プロデューサーさん\r\nちょっと雑誌読んでいきたいなって思ったんだ",
    "charAnim1": "surp2",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "amana",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/201400301/2014003010010"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "そうか\r\nそれ、ファッション雑誌か？",
    "charLabel": "amana",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2014003010020,
    "speaker": "甘奈",
    "text": "うん、そうだよー\r\n事務所って、いろんな雑誌があるよね！",
    "charAnim1": "smile2",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "amana",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/201400301/2014003010020"
  },
  {
    "id": 2014003010030,
    "speaker": "甘奈",
    "text": "だから、あれもこれもって\r\nついつい残って読んじゃうんだ☆",
    "charAnim1": "shy1",
    "charAnim2": "face_smile2",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "amana",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/201400301/2014003010030"
  },
  {
    "textFrame": "off",
    "se": "0100",
    "waitType": "time",
    "waitTime": 1000
  },
  {
    "id": 2014003010040,
    "speaker": "甘奈",
    "text": "ホント、どれもかっわい～",
    "charAnim2": "face_smile",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile2",
    "charLabel": "amana",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/201400301/2014003010040"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "楽しそうだな\r\nやっぱり甘奈は服を見るのが好きなんだな",
    "charLabel": "amana",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2014003010050,
    "speaker": "甘奈",
    "text": "まーね☆\r\nどんなコーデが似合うかなって、考えるのが好きなんだ",
    "charAnim1": "wait1",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "amana",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/201400301/2014003010050"
  },
  {
    "textFrame": "off",
    "se": "0100",
    "waitType": "time",
    "waitTime": 1000
  },
  {
    "id": 2014003010060,
    "speaker": "甘奈",
    "text": "あ、このチュールかわいー\r\nこっちのデニムのミニもいいかんじ！",
    "charAnim1": "surp1",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "amana",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/201400301/2014003010060"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "（雑誌を読むのに没頭してるな\r\nじゃあ俺は向こうへ……）",
    "charLabel": "amana",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2014003010070,
    "speaker": "甘奈",
    "text": "ねぇ、プロデューサーさん、これ見て！",
    "charAnim1": "wait2",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "amana",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/201400301/2014003010070"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "あ、ああ\r\nどれどれ？",
    "charLabel": "amana",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "effectLabel": "white1",
    "effectTarget": {
      "type": "rect",
      "width": 1136,
      "height": 640,
      "color": "ffffff"
    },
    "effectValue": {
      "type": "from",
      "alpha": 0,
      "time": 1000,
      "easing": "easeOutQuart"
    }
  },
  {
    "waitType": "time",
    "waitTime": 800
  },
  {
    "effectLabel": "white1",
    "effectValue": {
      "type": "to",
      "alpha": 0,
      "time": 1000,
      "easing": "easeInQuart"
    }
  },
  {
    "stillType": "idols",
    "stillId": "1030140010"
  },
  {
    "id": 2014003010080,
    "speaker": "甘奈",
    "text": "ほら、このブラウス！\r\nリボンとレースがいいカンジでしょー？",
    "charLabel": "amana",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/201400301/2014003010080"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "そうだな、可愛いんじゃないか？\r\n何かワンポイントあるとアクセントにもなるしな",
    "charLabel": "amana",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2014003010090,
    "speaker": "甘奈",
    "text": "だよね！　これにグレーのジャケットを合わせて……\r\nボトムスはショーパンがいいかな～",
    "charLabel": "amana",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/201400301/2014003010090"
  },
  {
    "id": 2014003010100,
    "speaker": "甘奈",
    "text": "あっでも、やっぱりスカートの方がいいかも！\r\nプロデューサーさんはどっちが好きー？",
    "charLabel": "amana",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/201400301/2014003010100"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "俺か？\r\n俺はどっちの組み合わせでもよく合うと思うぞ",
    "charLabel": "amana",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2014003010110,
    "speaker": "甘奈",
    "text": "ふむふむ、プロデューサーさんはどっちも好きか～\r\nあ、じゃあこのタイトスカートは？",
    "charLabel": "amana",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/201400301/2014003010110"
  },
  {
    "id": 2014003010120,
    "speaker": "甘奈",
    "text": "大人っぽく決めるのも、たまにはいいかもでしょ？",
    "charLabel": "amana",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/201400301/2014003010120"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "大人っぽくか……。今までそっちのテイストは\r\n考えてなかったが、試す価値はあるかもしれないな！",
    "charLabel": "amana",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2014003010130,
    "speaker": "甘奈",
    "text": "おっ！　プロデューサーさんがそう言ってくれるなら\r\nこれもチェックしておこうかな！",
    "charLabel": "amana",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/201400301/2014003010130"
  },
  {
    "id": 2014003010140,
    "speaker": "甘奈",
    "text": "あとは～……",
    "charLabel": "amana",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/201400301/2014003010140"
  },
  {
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "off",
    "se": "0100",
    "waitType": "time",
    "waitTime": 1000
  },
  {
    "id": 2014003010150,
    "speaker": "甘奈",
    "text": "あ、プロデューサーさん\r\nこのコーデ、どうかな？　めっちゃかわいくない～？",
    "charLabel": "amana",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/201400301/2014003010150"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "お、たしかにそうだな\r\nこれが今までチェックした中では甘奈に１番似合いそうだ",
    "charLabel": "amana",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2014003010160,
    "speaker": "甘奈",
    "text": "え、甘奈に！？",
    "charLabel": "amana",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/201400301/2014003010160"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "あれ？　なんで驚くんだ？\r\n似合うと思ったんだけど……",
    "charLabel": "amana",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "label": "still"
  },
  {
    "effectLabel": "white2",
    "effectTarget": {
